  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment in Growtheum Capital Partners SEA Fund I, LP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund will be managed by Growtheum, a regional private equity fund manager headquartered in Singapore. Growtheum I will primarily invest in midsized companies located or with significant business activities in Indonesia, the Philippines, and Viet Nam. The fund may also invest in companies operating in Malaysia, Singapore, and Thailand on an opportunistic basis. The fund will focus on health care, financial services, education, digital services, and consumer sectors. If approved, this will be the first investment by the Asian Development Bank (ADB) in a fund managed by Growtheum.</narrative>
  </description>
